{
  "id": "calorie-counter",
  "name": "Calorie Counter",
  "description": "Calorie Counter lets you log all of your daily calorie intake in a daily calorie diary. The database is originally seeded from the USDA foundation foods, and you can add also add your own custom foods, and even submit them for approval in the global database. You can even create your own custom recipes. All data is stored on your device, and you can also create an online account to sync your diary entries across devices.",
